00:42:52,366 --> 00:42:53,760
I think you know there are opportunities.

432
00:42:53,840 --> 00:43:05,220
So, when you talk about quantum, I think it starts with the fundamental science and materials, where India is establishing a lead right now to going to fabricating quantum devices and components.

