00:46:06,800 --> 00:46:09,920
Three or four people working on that, one of them will succeed.

462
00:46:10,126 --> 00:46:29,520
Eventually, somebody integrating all of that and then developing that particular thing that defense requires, or space requires, or atomic energy requires, whoever requires that end product needs to define those goals clearly for academic institutions and then fund projects, monitor them, integrate them, and finally develop something.

