And I think that learning has to happen like what has happened in China for the past 20 years, which has now put them on par with the US, right?

679
01:03:46,016 --> 01:03:48,336
It has to happen in India going forward.

680
01:03:48,558 --> 01:03:55,056
And once you learn it, then you know you have to apply it, you have to now develop new technologies using that knowledge.

681
01:03:55,310 --> 01:03:55,776
I think so.

682
01:03:55,856 --> 01:03:58,896
Therefore, for me, collaborations are always welcome.

683
